# Hopeful Initiate's "{2}{W}, Remove two +1/+1 counters from among creatures you control: Destroy target artifact or
# enchantment" (CR 118.3, 122.1, 602.2b). Bot1's Walking Ballista has two +1/+1 counters. On turn 3 Bot1's only white source,
# Mox Pearl, is tapped in the upkeep, so with five other mana sources the ability can't be paid (the {W}). The Initiate then
# trains attacking beside the 2/2 Ballista. On turn 5 a land is refused as a target, and the ability is activated for exactly
# {2}{W} (Mox Pearl, Mox Jet, Mox Ruby: nothing left in the pool), paid with one +1/+1 counter from each of the two creatures.
# Bot2's Mox Sapphire is destroyed; Bot2's own Ballista keeps its counter.

